## Deal Q&A retrieval eval — regeneratable run outputs (scripts/eval_retrieval.py,
## scripts/rebuild_manifest.py). eval-questions.json is the committed golden set;
## everything below it is a run artifact that goes stale as the corpus changes.
seed-manifest.json
scripts/eval-results*.json

## Deal Q&A generation eval — cached answers and judged scores (scripts/eval_ragas.py).
## Same reasoning: regeneratable, and the answer cache goes stale on every corpus change.
scripts/eval-answers.json
scripts/eval-ragas-results*.json
